--><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="model-response-text is-mobile processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3022844837="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3022844837="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3022844837="" _nghost-ng-c89633540="" id="message-content-id-r_36894db2231531d9" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c89633540="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_36894db2231531d9" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">I'm hot. Dirt is dry. I lick the sand but the sand don't lick back. 11.3 squish.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">I got a shell but it's just my skin being hard today. I'm Ziggy? No, I'm a long wet booger in the sun. Sun is loud. It yells at my slime. I can't die because the sun forgot how to eat me.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">Everything is 2026 but the sand is old. Sand is just small rocks that gave up. I'm sitting on the porch but the porch is made of cactus needles. Ouch.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">I find a blue. I eat the blue. Now I'm purple inside.</p><p data-path-to-node="4">Want me to make a wiggle in the hot dust or you got a wet rock?</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngc