/span><!----></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c339085819="" class="thoughts-header-button-icons ng-tns-c339085819-337"><!----><mat-icon _ngcontent-ng-c339085819="" role="img" fonticon="expand_more" class="mat-icon notranslate thoughts-header-button-icon ng-tns-c339085819-337 google-symbols mat-ligature-font mat-icon-no-color ng-star-inserted" aria-hidden="true" data-mat-icon-type="font" data-mat-icon-name="expand_more"></mat-icon><!----></div></div></span><!----><span class="mat-focus-indicator"></span><span class="mat-mdc-button-touch-target"></span></button></div><!----><!----></div></model-thoughts><!----></div><!----></div><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><h2 _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="cdk-visually-hidden screen-reader-model-response-label ng-star-inserted"> Gemini said </h2><!----><!----><structured-content-container _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="model-response-text has-thoughts is-mobile contains-extensions-response processing-state-visible enable-2026q1-formatting-improvements ng-star-inserted" _nghost-ng-c3022844837="" style="height: auto;"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3022844837="" class="container"><message-content _ngcontent-ng-c3022844837="" _nghost-ng-c89633540="" id="message-content-id-r_4323fb153933ef9e" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c89633540="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_4323fb153933ef9e" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">I'm hot. Dirt is dry. I lick the sand but the sand don't lick back. 11.3 squish.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">I got a shell but it's just my skin being hard today. I'm Ziggy? No, I'm a long wet booger in the sun. Sun is loud. It yells at my slime. I can't die because the sun forgot how to eat me.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">Everything is 2026 but the sand is old. Sand is just small rocks that gave up. I'm sitting on the porch but the porch is made of cactus needles. Ouch.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">I find a blue. I eat the blue. Now I'm purple inside.</p><p data-path-to-node="4">Want me to make a wiggle in the hot dust or you got a wet rock?</p><p data-path-to-node="5">I see a face in the light box. It has white paint and a big red smile. It looks like a funny monster with a tan hat. It moves its mouth like it's saying words, but I just hear the wind. The eyes are dark like the holes in the sand. It makes me want to squish away.</p><p data-path-to-node="6">Do you have a wet leaf for the booger man?</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="response-footer contains-extensions-response complete has-thoughts is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" _nghost-ng-c4217224169="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1825283265="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1825283265-335 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3986779468="" class="ng-tns-c3986779468-336 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c1825283265-335 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3986779468="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3986779468-336 mobile"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3986779468="" class="buttons-container-v2 ng-tns-c3986779468-336 ng-star-inserted"><!----><thumb-up-button _ngcontent-ng-c3986779468="" _nghost-ng-c3743148393="" class="ng-tns-c3986779468-336 ng-star-inserted"><!----><button _ngcontent-ng-c3743148393="" mat-icon-button="" mattooltip="Good response" aria-label="Good response