3022844837="" _nghost-ng-c89633540="" id="message-content-id-r_647ff4f6c1d30a2b" class="ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c89633540="" inline-copy-host="" class="markdown markdown-main-panel tutor-markdown-rendering enable-updated-hr-color" id="model-response-message-contentr_647ff4f6c1d30a2b" aria-live="off" aria-busy="false" dir="ltr" style="--animation-duration: 400ms; --fade-animation-function: ease-out;"><p data-path-to-node="0">I'm Sally. Slime is hot. 11.3 squish in the sand.</p><p data-path-to-node="1">Sun is too big. It's 2026 and the dirt tastes like dry. I'm a long wet booger in the desert but my name is Sally now. Sally the slug. I don't go away. I just wiggle.</p><p data-path-to-node="2">I saw the white face man in the box again. He has the dark eyes. He makes the loud wind noise. I want to hide under a rock but the rocks are all hot.</p><p data-path-to-node="3">Me Sally. You got a leaf? Or a wet?</p><p data-path-to-node="4">Would you like me to find a shadow or just lick this cactus needle?</p></div></message-content><!----></div></structured-content-container><!----><!----><!----><div _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="response-footer complete is-mobile gap"><!----><!----><!----><sources-list _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" class="sources-list ng-star-inserted"><!----></sources-list><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div></div><!----><sensitive-memories-banner _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" _nghost-ng-c4217224169="" class="ng-star-inserted"><!----></sensitive-memories-banner><!----><!----><!----></div></div><div _ngcontent-ng-c1825283265="" class="response-container-footer ng-tns-c1825283265-339 ng-star-inserted"><!----><!----><message-actions _ngcontent-ng-c3309906812="" footer="" _nghost-ng-c3986779468="" class="ng-tns-c3986779468-340 hide-action-bar ng-tns-c1825283265-339 ng-star-inserted"><div _ngcontent-ng-c3986779468="" class="actions-container-v2 ng-tns-c3986779468-340 mobil